    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d734">

                <pb facs="0871" n="777" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg777"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rockhill to Mr. Williams.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-09-07"><hi rendition="#italic">September 7,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1145.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Your cable dispatch of the 6th instant has
                    been received, as follows: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Aguirre just released and Sanguily’s case will be tried soon.</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>Mr. Aguirre’s friends have been informed of his release. Your report of the
                    circumstances of his enlargement are awaited before commenting on this tardy
                    relief of a citizen of the United States confined under conditions which have
                    enlisted the lively sympathy and earnest efforts of this Government in his
                    behalf.</p>
                <p>You will continue to press for speedy and equitable treatment of Sanguily’s
                    case.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. W. Rockhill.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
